      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On July 20, Hermès held a preview of its Fall/Winter 2026 collection at the Shanghai Hermès Maison. Staying true to the annual theme \"Venture Beyond,\" the season's pieces artfully blend equestrian and nautical elements with everyday inspiration, inviting viewers to sense the call of distant horizons in the familiar and discover wonder in the ordinary.",
