    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "New Kelly and Bolide bags don sporty \"racing gear\" with a specially designed Paddock protector. Inspired by the blankets draped over horses in equestrian competition, the cover is crafted from Twillcoat, the same water-repellent cotton canvas used in Hermès trench coats, offering protection from rain. Functional exterior pockets and snap buttons add practicality. Matching leather trim outlines the silhouette and pocket lines, while rounded corners help distribute weight, infusing the bags with a vintage workwear aesthetic.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
