    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bolide 1923 mini handbag debuts with a Clou de forge jewelry chain strap. This new chain merges silversmithing and leather craftsmanship: 23 hand-assembled silver links are centered with a gold horseshoe nail, then interwoven with leather cords. The gleaming two-tone chain adds a lively sparkle to the bag.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
