    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bolide 1923 mini Élan handbag reinterprets the classic Bolide in a sleek East-West silhouette. Crafted from Mysore goatskin, it comes in fresh hues like rock gray and lemon yellow. Its compact form and removable strap allow for shoulder or crossbody wear.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/d316bda705519fa1.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/e1e003f6f073586a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
