      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bolide 1923 Secret handbag features a zippered bottom compartment with ample storage for organizing shoes and other items. Modular dividers are reinforced by a fully leather-wrapped aluminum structure to protect contents. Two leather pulls are attached to metal closures, and a padlock secures the zipper for added safety.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
