    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Other Bags ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/66637fe847382f87.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/65d09eaeaf85846f.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A new tote bag is crafted from panels of Togo calfskin and Swift calfskin, seamed together with visible saddle stitching that traces its fluid lines. The shoulder strap running across the top is inspired by stirrup leathers, paying homage to equestrian heritage. The spacious interior is lined in H canvas, with wide accordion pleats lending structure and durability.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/24e6e501e4a8dc5e.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/00693a5ef8ba9731.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/af2e46ccbade2cc1.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/504e71692f87e183.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Clou de forge shoulder bag takes its cue from horseshoe nails. Two-tone gold and silver nails morph into closures that follow the bag's curve and into buckles for adjusting the strap. The flap slips through the closure like a bridle through a ring, ensuring smooth opening and closing. Made from glossy Box calfskin, the bag features clean, streamlined double accordion pleats.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/7e70894f07c33f71.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/30e9d371fe6d1873.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
