    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A shoulder bag in Swift calfskin offers a compact, lightweight cylindrical silhouette. A top zip closure is accented with the iconic H padlock, while the clean design remains elegant and understated.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/4bab05e245c64c34.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/8557fe11562e344d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/3b8a11aa6b97db87.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/0a100bc351a1ed88.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Double Longe bucket bag draws inspiration from equestrian tack. Its Barénia grained calfskin body meets a Barénia Faubourg smooth leather base. The standout feature is the metal spring hook and ring on the side: the strap can be threaded through the ring and folded double for shoulder or crossbody wear.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
