          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/043470c7a8fec80d.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/943e94c6ccaf84df.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/323bb26e8e3e9789.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/b14eba643239a6bc.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/c503a775d00eef9e.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Mousqueton backpack is crafted from a single piece of calfskin for a minimalist bucket shape. A metal spring hook attached to a ring forms a secure closure system, continuing the equestrian motif. The adjustable strap allows for shoulder or back carry.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/8146a929d6f24bf8.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/046a3b72f6083f46.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/0de75969f482bfa7.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/9e715cf66d6811f0.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Hobo Coins de malle handbag is made from soft, lustrous Evergrain calfskin. Lightweight and versatile, it can be worn on the shoulder or crossbody, with a laptop compartment inside and an accordion pocket on the front. Its signature detail is the reinforced corner design, inspired by the house's historic trunk craftsmanship. The corners extend from the front and back, folding over the accordion pleats to create soft rounded edges accented with stitching.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/4fa565cad7746eb3.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/k5qvb2c/ad6e952abbb5066a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Small Leather Goods ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new season's small leather goods are equally exciting. The In the Pocket series introduces practical accessories like a monocular, earphone case, round storage box, magnifying glass, tape measure, and mini pouch—offering refined aids for daily life while doubling as statement pieces to elevate any outfit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
